### 1. Direct OpenWeather API Test (No Backend Required)
GET https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather?q=Bangalore,Karnataka,IN&appid=309e3e7df1837d5086748a4231e93882&units=metric

### 2. Login to AgriSaarthi Local Backend to get JWT Token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Test AgriSaarthi Weather API via Backend (Using Token from Step 2)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET http://localhost:5000/api/weather?location=Bangalore&state=Karnataka
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Test AgriSaarthi Weather by Geographic Coordinates (Lat / Lon)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/weather?latitude=12.9716&longitude=77.5946
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
